869b65e265&scene=126&sessionid=1795155390#rd","description":"过去谈 DevSecOps，很多团队关心的是怎样把安全更早地放进研发流程里。现在，AI 已经进入软件开发生命周期，于是 DevSecOps 面临一个更现实的问题：当 AI 开始参与写代码、改代码、审代码，安全、合规和工程效率应该怎么重新组织？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FVoF2eOII0kQSNOZWXvPSMmt0EXWGjuNqKbYj0szcEXcIIa7t8kRGdhTicZal8icFXWfmRX8nHPwS0q2qlWQwmAWibwaZbZk69QMcM7NeRPqX54%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-07-22T12:21:42.000Z"}]}